@ifnottex
@node Top
@top Waybox

Waybox is a Wayland compositor modelled on Openbox.  It reads Openbox's
configuration files and themes, and leaves panels, wallpapers, launchers
and other desktop functions to separate programs.

This manual describes how to start Waybox and how to use it.  The
complete reference for its settings is the @samp{waybox(5)} manual page.

